  "prefLabel": "Plc 102.33 Regulated profession",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Plc 102.33 “Regulated profession” means an occupation or profession for which a license is required to be obtained from the OPLC based on criteria established in applicable law, including rules adopted by the applicable board, prior to engaging in the occupation or profession in New Hampshire.\n\nSource. #14135, eff 12-1-24",
